# Sprite-palette plan for the RPG template.
#
# The OBJ palettes are the axis that grows as the game gains NPCs, enemies
# and items — exactly where a planner earns its keep. palplan assigns each
# a collision-free sprite slot and writes palplan.h, so main.c never
# hard-codes a CGRAM index or an OAM palette number: add a villager here
# and the slots stay correct for free.
#
# (The BG palettes are managed differently — the two scenes SWAP the same
#  slot 0 at runtime and the text layer owns slot 1 via setColor(), a
#  dynamic layout palplan's static plan deliberately does not model.)
#
# name   type    file
hero     sprite  hero.pal
npc      sprite  npc.pal
